     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "The nearest neighbor algorithm chooses the best choice at every branch of the path, continuing to make the best choice at each stage and finally linking those choices together into an overall solution. This might miss the best possible solution overall but is much faster than the brute force algorithm."
